    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1151">

                <pb facs="0951" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg835"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/834a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 966.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-09-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 5, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Department’s
                    telegraphic instructions of September 5, I have the honor to inclose to you
                    herewith presentation copy of the note therein discussed,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1151-f1"/> which the President directs you to present textually to
                    the Mexican Government.</p>
                <p>You will, when presenting the note, state officially, but orally, that such are
                    your instructions.</p>
                <p>As stated in the Department’s telegram under reference, the Department desires
                    from you, by telegraph, such suggestions and recommendations as to policy or
                    substance as you think it necessary to give, or in case there are any points in
                    the text herewith transmitted to you which do not seem to you well stated or
                    apposite.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1151-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1151-f1-content">
                <p>See revised draft, the American Ambassador to the Minister for Foreign Affairs,
                    September 15.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
